{"reviews":[{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-0","r":1.0,"t":"Poor quality","x":"Does not work as described in description. Chalky waste of money.","h":48,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-1","r":1.0,"t":"Product does not work as advertised","x":"Product does not work as advertised..waste of time and money.","h":37,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-2","r":3.0,"t":"Does not work like video says","x":"This product smells and feels fine when putting on your skin. However it does not pull out impurities as the video suggests it does. I'm going to keep using to see if I see a change over time. But I'm not holding my breath. I mean I knew it wouldn't do exactly what the video said as the video looked fake.  But, I was hoping that it would pull out impurities and that I would be able to tell immediately.  But it doesn't.","h":35,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-3","r":1.0,"t":"Would not recommend.","x":"I think this product was defective or old. I don't think I will put it on my face, so I can't comment on if it is for sensitive skin or not. It smells like clay for pottery. Also it is a mask.... so you wouldn't really wear it out so I'm not sure what sheerness has to do with it. Also my order arrived a week late.","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-4","r":2.0,"t":"Not like the commercials","x":"Was expecting something like in their commercials. Just fits in very thick","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-5","r":5.0,"t":"Meets expectations","x":"It's great if you have a greasy face but not for everyday use, how I use it is one yes, one no and clearly see an awesome difference I'm my face is cleaner and blackheads are less obviously combine with my daily regular care routine.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-6","r":1.0,"t":"DO NOT BUY!!!!","x":"I\u2019m a licensed Master Esthetician.  I work in a medical office and I am an aesthetic laser specialist.  DO NOT BUY THIS PRODUCT!  It absolutely does not do what is says or is shown on videos I\u2019ve seen. If you aren\u2019t trained how to prep for a clay mask, you will be lost as the instructions are in kanji (Asian writing).  It is very oily.  It is very thin.  It doesn\u2019t dry like a clay or detoxifying mask should. I did half of my face and now I\u2019m breaking out in little bumps.  We usually know what we","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-7","r":1.0,"t":"It\u2019s garbage!!\ud83d\ude21\ud83d\ude21\ud83d\ude21\ud83d\ude21","x":"They are lier\u2019s it don\u2019t work at s as ll !!! What a wast of my time !!\ud83d\ude21\ud83d\ude21\ud83d\ude21\ud83d\ude21\ud83d\ude21","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-8","r":1.0,"t":"Worst product ever!","x":"[[VIDEOID:aa695f9322dbfea05aeb07ba6643f3cf]] There has never been a terrible product I ve tried like this before. I can't believe how they even launched it in the market.  First, none of the claims are true. Second, this thing makes your skin extremely dry. Third messed up the PH of the skin. Fourth, it is not for all skin types. My skin ended up having allergic reaction after the first try. Fifth, the brand shows Median, but the seller sent twice the brand, Mensiqi. Now thats truly messed up.  ","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-9","r":5.0,"t":"Feels great on skin, but advertising is misleading","x":"Felt great on my face, very refreshing,  but the pictures are leading, I was hoping my black heads would magically appear on top to be wiped away..that didn't happen","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-10","r":1.0,"t":"Not as advertised...","x":"Does NOT work like the advertisement showed. I had to marks that turned to whiteheads Could not just wipe off blackheads did not appear as presented.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-11","r":1.0,"t":"Do not buy it","x":"This is not truth it doesn\u2019t work at all not even to clean the face it\u2019s asking me to put a start so I can MoveOn but I wouldn\u2019t even give it a start","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-12","r":1.0,"t":"Don't work as advertised in the video","x":"It's not a trouble product but it does no work as it does in the videos that are advertised.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-13","r":4.0,"t":"A cool way to apply a clay mask","x":"I'm not saying these don't work, because I'm sure they work as well as any other clay mask. It's just presented in an easier way to spread around your face. I don't have anything bad to say about them. But I'm also not saying they're superior to any other clay mask.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-14","r":1.0,"t":"Don't sell products that are false advertisement","x":"The item is no good it doesn't work as it shows you on videos false advertisement and my face needed it but it didn't work as they said it should","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-15","r":1.0,"t":"Worthless product","x":"This product is worthless and does not do what you claim it does. I recommend people dont waste their money on this. Please give me my money back","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-16","r":1.0,"t":"Don't waste your money","x":"It doesn't do what the video shows.  Aa far as delivery and store service,  it was good. I received it quickly but the product doesn't work.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-17","r":1.0,"t":"Don't waste your money","x":"It doesn't do what the video shows.  Aa far as delivery and store service,  it was good. I received it quickly but the product doesn't work.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-18","r":1.0,"t":"Heck no don't buy this","x":"This mess did NOT do what was advertised.... It's chalky and leaves the skin dry and irritable... Don't buy this mess.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-19","r":2.0,"t":"Not as advertised but...","x":"Did not take out blackheads as advertised but  It was soft on the skin and seemed to clean the skin relatively well","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-20","r":1.0,"t":"it doesnt  work as advertised","x":"This product showed no result on my skin in any way I can't recommend","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-21","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t buy it.","x":"This produce does not work at all like advertised.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-22","r":1.0,"t":"No instructions!","x":"My first impression as I open the package\u2026 NO instructions in English. Was I suppose to learn Chinese to use the products? Used it on my face (as is), it never fully dried even after a 1/2 hour, as I have seen on its advertisement. Again, no instruction, not sure what to do. I have given these 2 products multiple chances. This is definitely FALSE ADVERTISEMENT! I do have black head and have yet to see 1 single black spot spearing on the mask. The purple one does absolutely NOTHING for my skin. T","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-23","r":3.0,"t":"excited to try, but disappointed","x":"According to the video ads that are popping up all over social media for this, the blackheads all rise to and above the surface of the skin in all of their disgusting glory. A person wipes them away to reveal flawless, blemish-free skin. I was so excited to see that happen! It doesn't. It's just a roll on clay mask that takes a bit longer to dry then makes your skin feel the dryest it has been since it just takes away all of the oils. If you want a roll on mask, this is great. Just not what the ","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08QMJLMCQ-24","r":1.0,"t":"Save your money","x":"I was really excited to try this product since I\u2019ve seen so many ads for it. I tried both and left them on for more than 15 minutes and nothing happened. I didn\u2019t get any of the blackheads to appear, no burning sensation, or anything. I even went on YouTube to see how to properly use this mask and the end result was......it doesn\u2019t work. Highly disappointed and false advertisement","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers say the product does not work as advertised or as shown in the videos.","cites":[1,2,3,7,8,11,12,13,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers specifically report it fails to pull out blackheads or impurities as promised.","cites":[3,10,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers describe it as a waste of money or a poor-quality product.","cites":[1,2,8,9]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the product smells like clay and feels fine or refreshing on the skin.","cites":[3,4,10]},{"text":"Some positive reviewers say it works well as a clay mask and leaves skin cleaner, though not necessarily better than other clay masks.","cites":[6,14]}]},"qa":[]}